# Google Maps Platform API Key (NEVER commit your real .env file!)
#
# Option 1: Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping Only)
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with a Google account (no billing card required)
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted
# 4. Click to generate / reveal the demo key
# 5. Copy the key below (note: daily reset limit applies; not for production)
#
# Option 2: Production Google Cloud API Key
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API, Elevation API, Weather API
# Restrict by HTTP referrer and specific APIs:
# https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
